# Settings for the SSO API (compose profile "sso"). Copy to sso.env on the server and fill it in; it is gitignored.
# AUTH0_AUDIENCE and AUTH0_ORG_ID must match the Vercel site's values.
# https://AUTH0_DOMAIN/ including the trailing slash
AUTH0_ISSUER=https://dev-3es7focax4cjcswg.us.auth0.com/
AUTH0_AUDIENCE=
AUTH0_ORG_ID=
# Supabase project origin and server-only secret key
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
# Optional: answers from Groq's free plan (D55), which has no card on file and can't bill. Both APIs share the Groq
# account's per-minute and per-day limits, so each keeps its own daily allowance.
# LLM_PROVIDER=groq
# LLM_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
# LLM_MAX_TOKENS=4000
# Model answers per UTC day for signed-in people. After that, the built-in writer answers until midnight UTC.
# LLM_DAILY_ANSWERS=100
# Optional: semantic search with Cloudflare Workers AI's bge-m3 (D56). Cloudflare sees the text of every chunk,
# restricted documents included. Keep the account on Workers Free, which refuses calls past the daily allocation
# instead of billing. Run pnpm llm:calibrate with these settings first.
# EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=cloudflare
# EMBEDDING_API_KEY=
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
